OL,3,GNEWSAPlans submitted for 130 homes in
OL,4,Avillage
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been formally submitted to
OL,7,Fbuild 130 homes on the edge of a
OL,8,FLeicestershire village.
OL,10,FKeepmoat Homes wants to construct a mix
OL,11,Fof one, two, three and four-bedroom
OL,12,Fhomes off Wood Lane in Higham on the
OL,13,FHill. The plans also include a
OL,14,Fcommunity centre providing "potential
OL,15,Fsocial, educational, recreational and
OL,16,Fwelfare services for residents" as well
OL,17,Fas two areas of open space.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
