OL,3,GNEWSAPlans submitted for 130 homes in
OL,4,Avillage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA specialist assessment has also been
OL,7,Fcommissioned to examine any risk of
OL,8,Funexploded wartime ordnance at the site
OL,9,Fdue to the proximity of the former RAF
OL,10,FLindley which closed in 1946.
OL,12,FHinckley and Bosworth Borough Council
OL,13,Fis expected to make a decision on the
OL,14,Fapplication in the coming months.
